,{"h":"10/100/1000 BaseT, Compatible with Cambium PoE","c":[]},{"h":"Point-to-Point (PTP): 3 to 10 km","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 1 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h2>The ePMP™ Force 180 5 GHz subscriber module is the next generation of the ePMP 5 GHz Integrated Radio, offering a higher-gain, integrated 16 dBi patch antenna.</h2><p><br>Installation and alignment are easy with the adjustable mounting bracket, and the Force 180 is small, sleek, and equipped witha&nbsp; Gigabit Ethernet port to deliver the maximum throughput.</p><p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"1063\">The <strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"778\">Cambium Networks ePMP 180</strong> is a cost-effective and efficient <strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"836\">5GHz wireless radio</strong> built for <strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"877\">Point-to-Multipoint (PTMP)</strong> deployments. With an <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"940\">integrated 16 dBi directional antenna</strong> and <strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"963\">up to 200 Mbps</strong> throughput, it is ideal for subscriber modules (SM) or small PTP links in rural and suburban areas.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1386\">The ePMP 180 is part of Cambium's reliable ePMP ecosystem, providing <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1141\">QoS</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1155\">GPS sync</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1198\">interference-tolerant performance</strong> at a budget-friendly price. Designed to ensure <strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1280\">high availability, scalability</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1312\">easy remote management</strong>, it is perfect for <strong data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1340\">ISPs</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1350\">SMEs</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1372\">surveillance</strong> applications.</p><p><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1416\"><strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1416\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1764\"><li data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1454\">\n<p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1454\">Frequency Band: 5.150 – 5.970 GHz</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1501\">\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1501\">Built-in Antenna: 16 dBi directional panel</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1530\">\n<p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1530\">Max Throughput: 200 Mbps</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1559\">\n<p data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1559\">GPS Synchronization: Yes</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1609\">\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1609\">QoS Support: Triple play (voice, video, data)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1636\">\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1636\">TDD Mode: Configurable</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1669\">\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1669\">Outdoor IP55-rated enclosure</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1711\">\n<p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1711\">Web GUI and remote management support</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1764\">\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1764\">Compatible with ePMP Access Points and LinkPlanner</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1797\"><strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1795\"><br></strong></h3><h3 data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1797\"><strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1795\">Link Distance:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1923\"><li data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1851\">\n<p data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1851\"><strong data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1823\">Typical PTMP Range:</strong> 3 – 10 km (Line-of-sight)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1923\">\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1923\"><strong data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1874\">Short PTP Links:</strong> 5 – 8 km (depending on alignment and conditions)</p></li></ul><p><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1952\"><strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1950\">Use Cases:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2107\"><li data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1977\">\n<p data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1977\">ISP last-mile access</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2018\">\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2018\">Small office/home wireless broadband</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2045\">\n<p data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2045\">Wireless CCTV backhaul</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2071\">\n<p data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2071\">Industrial automation</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2107\">\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2107\">Campus/building wireless bridging</p></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cambium Networks ePMP 5GHz Force 300-25 High-Gain 500+ Mbps Radio with Integrated 25dBi Dish Antenna","href":"/cambium-networks-epmp-5ghz-force-300-25-high-gain-500-mbps-radio-with-integrated-25dbi-dish-antenna","now":"58,000৳","old":"60,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Ubiquiti LBE-M5-23 airMAX LiteBeam M5 100+ Mbps Wireless Radio Link","href":"/ubiquiti-lbe-m5-23-airmax-litebeam-m5-150-mbps-wireless-radio-link","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Ubiquiti airMAX NanoStation M5 NSM5 5GHz 150+ Mbps 16dBi CPE Wireless Radio Link","href":"/ubiquiti-airmax-nanostation-m5-nsm5-5ghz-150-mbps-16dbi-cpe-wireless-radio-link","now":"24,000৳","old":"26,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cambium Networks ePMP 5GHz ePMP Force 300-16 Radio 500Mbps with 16dBi Integrated Antenna","href":"/cambium-networks-epmp-5ghz-epmp-force-300-16-radio-500mbps-with-16dbi-integrated-antenna","now":"46,000৳","old":"47,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cambium Networks 5GHz PTP 550 Connectorized 1.4 Gbps Poi